<title>UK: GSI sets call warrants on Alusuisse.</title>
<headline>GSI sets call warrants on Alusuisse.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued 12 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Alusuisse-Lonza Holding AG, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,550 CHF		 PREMIUM	15.03 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.42 CHF		  GEARING	10.43 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 25.JUN.97-16.OCT.98   PAYDATE	24.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,470 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  GSJR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
